cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its data, please cite the paper given under preferred-citation."
type: software
title: "PI-SASR: Physics-Informed Surrogate-Assisted Scenario Reduction for Two-Stage Stochastic Unit Commitment"
version: 1.0.0
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation, processed input data, numerical results and
  reproduction scripts of physics-informed surrogate-assisted scenario
  reduction (PI-SASR) for two-stage stochastic unit commitment, validated on
  fleets derived from the synthetic TX-123BT and Texas2k Series25 Texas grids.
